u00e9el. Lancez-vous dans cette exp\u00e9rience de pr\u00e9vention personnalis\u00e9e afin de pouvoir profiter pleinement et en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de vos journ\u00e9es \u00e0 la neige. Parviendrez-vous \u00e0 gagner toutes les \u00e9toiles de neige en prenant les bonnes d\u00e9cisions?", "short_description": "Entra\u00eenez-vous \u00e0 adopter un comportement prudent sur des pistes virtuelles en vous r\u00e9f\u00e9rant aux r\u00e8gles de la FIS. Aiguisez votre conscience des risques et apprenez \u00e0 pr\u00e9venir les accidents gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une conduite prudente. "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon_squared.png", "id": "1874194369960207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_1874194373293540_4582662405311107528_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EFngx2LR6oEQ7kNvwHnoZKq&_nc_oc=AdoQ5oO79hNPUt1lLzRE-84HZ97nqa5nMF8vQLslE-w6ayTJDNJaOrIF6fkQD9HQK5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqcf4cDwAREE8j7H-I8NZWjZBfa27E3p12e4Qkjn-v7Q&oe=6B09BEFC"}, {"file_name": "Hochformat.png", "id": "1529531315438026", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1529531325438025_4790183514454408327_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gPwVTb-Ds-IQ7kNvwGeid_p&_nc_oc=AdrNWMjCN2FAjEB4_HIpNzGWaz7hceiVDQUjOprZ9YNOFSMpgDHiT8eQw5nKoz3Fpic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKMalthZ3jtKzi80JqS8vdSxtrvsfBxof4r5OMMx1YnQ&oe=6B09BC8B"}, {"file_name": "Quadrat.png", "id": "1490558009564346", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1490558012897679_2364028629671793037_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sMjjrfMUQnYQ7kNvwFRkN-Q&_nc_oc=AdqUPkAwGEq7ajqglbvAyqmAA5gsdGZP6DgNnfCz2clpZ1x2TOXI2d8d-irFqgLDzK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_h